:: Wake-up Alarm [nobr]

You are startled awake by the buzzing sound of your alarm clock. You groan in displeasure, your body desperate to fall back asleep. But eventually, the annoying beeping from your alarm forces you awake. You hit the button on the top of the clock with a bit of force, letting out your frustration on being pulled from the dream realm. Time to begin another day. <br>
